<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page journal-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/blog'>Project journal</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">case study <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1>MBK Markets: exploring a clearer view of market data</h1><p class="article-deck">A cryptocurrency market dashboard built to bring a broad coin catalogue, live market information and technical charts into one interface.</p></section>
<div class="academy-reading-layout"><aside class="academy-toc"><p class="academy-kicker">IN THIS PROJECT</p><nav aria-label="On this page"><a href="#main-content">Project overview</a></nav><div class="academy-author"><img src="/assets/images/mbk-personal-favicon-96.png" width="38" height="38" alt=""><div>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Founder, MBK Global</small></div></div><p class="academy-read-note">2 min read · Practical learning notes<br>Learn. Apply. Make it your own.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/resources'>More learning resources ↗</a></aside><div class="academy-reading-body"><p class="eyebrow">MBK JOURNAL / ARTICLE</p><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>← All articles</a></p><article class="journal-article" id="mbk-markets"><div class="article-index">04 <span>DATA UI</span></div><div class="article-body"><p class="article-kicker">MAKING INFORMATION LEGIBLE</p><p>MBK Markets presents information for more than 10,000 cryptocurrency coins, helping visitors browse a wide range of digital assets from one place. The interface is designed to make market information easier to scan, compare and explore instead of overwhelming visitors with an unstructured list of numbers.</p><p>Interactive charts include candlestick-style views that help users inspect price movements and market trends over time. Live values and chart details depend on the connected data source and its update status, so users should check the displayed timeframe and source before relying on a figure.</p><p>The project explores data presentation, responsive layout and chart-driven market analysis. It is an informational tool, not financial advice or a recommendation to buy or sell any asset.</p><p><a class="article-link" href="https://mbkmarkets.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Explore MBK Markets ↗</a></p><div class="article-meta">MBK MARKETS · INTERFACE NOTES</div></div></article><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>Back to the MBK journal ↗</a></p><section aria-label="Related MBK portfolio pages" class="mbk-related-links"><h2>Explore related MBK pages</h2><p>Continue exploring Bakhtawar Khan (MBK), MBK Global projects and practical digital technology resources.</p><ul><li><a href="/">Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global — Web Development, AI &amp; Digital Technology</a></li><li><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global</a></li><li><a href='/projects'>Projects by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/services'>Web Development, AI, APIs &amp; SEO Services | Bakhtawar Khan</a></li><li><a href='/resources'>Web Development, API, SEO &amp; Accessibility Resources | MBK</a></li><li><a href='/blog'>Articles &amp; Guides by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/official-links'>Official Links &amp; Projects</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/article-mbk-tv'>MBK TV Project | Digital Media Experience by MBK</a></li><li><a href='/article-mbk-tools'>MBK Downloader &amp; Text to Handwriting | MBK Projects</a></li><li><a href='/article-noor-e-quran'>Noor-e-Quran Project | Digital Learning Experience by MBK</a></li></ul></section></div></div><div data-portrait-track data-caption="The person behind the work"></div></main><script src="assets/js/script.js"></script><footer class="academy-footer"><div><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><p>Thoughtful technology. Useful knowledge. Work in progress.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/official-links'>Official links</a><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/resume'>Resume</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a></nav><div class="academy-colophon"><span>© 2026 Bakhtawar Khan · MBK Global</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer><script defer src="/assets/js/portfolio.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/visual-track.js"></script></body>